{
  "bookId": "hero-212204",
  "id": "bond-27525",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27525001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "看来人类的世界有很多烦恼呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27525003",
              "text": "大概吧。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "27525003",
              "text": "……你又知道什么了？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27525002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27525003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "你的浏览记录，在你睡着的时候，我顺便翻了一下~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27525005",
              "text": "侵犯隐私可是不好的行为。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27525004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27525005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "那你得管好自己的手指，网络没有隐私可言。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27525006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "听起来真像是无法无天的家伙才会说的话。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27525007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "无法无天？主动挑衅我的人都不会有好下场，\n但你是个例外，不过这是暂时的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27525009",
              "text": "暂时？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "27525009",
              "text": "那会到什么时间呢？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27525008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27525009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "等到月亮爆炸，等到太阳西升东落，等到世界上再也没有刺身和法餐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27525011",
              "text": "……这是告白吗？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "27525011",
              "text": "那就是永远咯？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27525010",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27525011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "随你理解。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27525012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "好了，生活的烦恼就随它们的便吧，\n及时行乐，听我的没错~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "27525",
